    "description": "Grow your career with Metro Cash & Carry Capital India! We are hiring a Department Manager for our Thane team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Metro Cash & Carry Capital India:\nMetro Cash & Carry Capital India is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Prepare daily sales reports and share insights with management\n• Coordinate with the supply chain team for timely stock delivery\n• Manage shrinkage and reduce stock discrepancies\n• Assist in recruiting, onboarding, and performance management of staff\n• Monitor inventory levels and coordinate replenishment activities\n• Build relationships with regular customers to drive loyalty\n• Implement promotional activities and in-store campaigns\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Retail Operations\n• Proficiency in Category Management\n• Proficiency in Planogram\n• Proficiency in Visual Merchandising\n• Proficiency in KPI Management\n• Proficiency in Customer Service\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Sales Techniques\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Thane, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Metro Cash & Carry Capital India!",
